# Champions of the Perfect: "Whenever you cast a creature spell, draw a card." Turn 1 Bot1 casts it beholding an Elvish Mystic. Turn 3 Bot1 draws
# Llanowar Elves and casts it with the Forest: the trigger resolves before the Elves do and Bot1 draws a Forest (the Champions' own cast did
# not trigger itself: it was not on the battlefield). A land cast would not have triggered it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Elvish Mystic
Champions of the Perfect
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
